{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "95af3bd8d6c51dad20959cae0d2ad5441b53598228a87f80ae7154cca4419b73", "ja": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』宣伝のため、\nのり子がトーク番組に出演することになった）", "zh": "（为了宣传《BATTLE OF THEATER》，诺莉子要出演一档谈话节目了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a1e36e584a75bfab6d002bf802ee0c0116ac72586c5c00b66d8f4f4e4616b023", "ja": "（依頼を受けた当初は、\n自由にやっていい、という話だったのだが……）", "zh": "（刚接到邀请时，\n对方说可以自由发挥，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "591254e5c460cbe538500a4d73744440808912475a2cded71cf8a90060109d58", "ja": "えっ！？　台本アリなんですか？", "zh": "咦！？还有剧本的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1003_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "172d7488a046a3be0d4b8af1d4fb304b5ec9181948c3c8b7fa586b9e0c647630", "ja": "すみません！　上が大のプロレスファンでして……\nどうしても入れて欲しい流れがある、と。", "zh": "不好意思！因为上司是个超级职业摔跤迷……他说有一段流程无论如何都想加进去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aaae51449a049cc46e87ae2d43f730b70f01d90324ce4619b62c8f6a509111ab", "ja": "ええと……のり子がプロレス愛を熱く語りすぎて、\n周りを困らせてしまう……ですか。", "zh": "呃……是说因为诺莉子太热情地讲述对摔跤的热爱，结果让周围的人为难……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "9ff1a3e444af1ce1c97e56ef0da3e51daba8aca67e1ae36a0d0084101db0b4e5", "ja": "出演者たちから総ツッコミ、イジられる……\nあはは！　コミカルな感じですよね？　いいですよ！", "zh": "被其他出演者集体吐槽、调侃……  \n啊哈哈！就是这种搞笑的感觉对吧？没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "86a7dad4244254eae1ffdea11495dccb0331e1f3bef4fb7ddde59f8e53285f51", "ja": "本気で引かれるくらい、熱く語っちゃって\nいいってことですよね？　まかせてくださいっ！", "zh": "就是要热情地讲到让人真的招架不住，也没关系，对吧？交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1007_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "12b40273ff1b28bbc0a4f8b3eccd40c28e622e345907801759c26d7421fc643e", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　では……\n打ち合わせは以上となります。よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "非常感谢！那么……\n商讨到这里就结束了。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e5662360df92c8f6260207bd793d5dbf4c5a2b25d4b688003ab3e8ba1bd951fa", "ja": "のり子、本当によかったのか？\n最初の話と違うし、断ることもできるぞ。", "zh": "纪子，真的没问题吗？\n这和一开始说的不一样，你也可以拒绝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "04a564825be59c497dd33b5c3072a839425cbee23f593abecaa4381c6979ed01", "ja": "大丈夫！　言ったでしょ？　ブックがあるなら\nあるなりに、しっかりこなすのが一流だって。", "zh": "没问题！我不是说过吗？既然有剧本，\n就要根据剧本好好完成，这才是一流。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "bc8b69e991ac345a2d9a6cf1670d8193387a21713c16ccfb58eb91804c7ce2da", "ja": "見ててよ{$P$}……\nアタシのビッグマッチを！　……なんてね、へへっ。", "zh": "{$P$}，你看好了……\n我的大场面！……说笑啦，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "16f473ec5df1bcd2290b88a7bbe064601423b4dde600288ba3251916cd81258a", "ja": "いや本当に凄かったんですよ、あの決め技！\nちょっと立ってみてください、こういう感じで……", "zh": "不，那个终结技真的太厉害了！\n请您稍微站起来一下，就像这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1013_kyouensya1", "source_sha256": "772fa539b7ac568458a5d9fa41f17c59db88193577385d2aaefa7af88281af75", "ja": "なるほどね、こういう……って、なに技かけようと\nしてんの！？　ダメダメ！　死んじゃう死んじゃう！", "zh": "原来如此，是这种……等等，你这是要对我使什么招！？不行不行！会死的，会死的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "aec7bed4e0a7bb277de09bcab78f26d847479b0d7540048dc391be8fc240ef37", "ja": "ハハハハハ！", "zh": "哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1015_kyouensya2", "source_sha256": "8d63890233641de2138dc9b75079e308c73dfee93c31195c0c8c7adaf085208a", "ja": "ちょっと福田ちゃん、落ち着いてよ～……\n熱すぎて、みんな置いてけぼりだって！", "zh": "福田，冷静一点嘛～……\n太热血了，大家都快跟不上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "dacadf0ada25636e50ea3e181ecc492a8b1c9d90d7c09cfd4f157b5d96c49781", "ja": "ああっ、ごめんなさいっ！　でも、プロレスファンの\n同志たちに、熱くないアタシは見せられないし……。", "zh": "啊，对不起！不过，我可不能让摔跤迷的\n同好们看到不够热情的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "463e8be4d380f1723c4b3d7606ed560ced5a7691af159d52601c1f6a4316608a", "ja": "それに、こんなチャンスなかなかないですから！\n今日は全員、プロレス好きになるまで帰しませんよ！", "zh": "而且，这样的机会可不常有！今天不让大家都喜欢上职业摔跤，我是不会让你们回去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1018_kyouensya1", "source_sha256": "8b5c2b4b75ed04eef29ef8a89c248418e73f99bbbf8aaf2a577312809cbe6e06", "ja": "ヤバイぜ！？　俺たちは鳴らしてしまったんだ……\n試合開始のゴングを！", "zh": "糟糕了！？我们竟然敲响了……  \n比赛开始的钟声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "afd091e3f93fcf323f4201248a9a2947858bf471104444155e13d0f2d7863dec", "ja": "プロレスってね、人間なんですよ！　喜びも、\n悔しさも、意地も……全部、リングの上にあるんです！", "zh": "职业摔角啊，就是人类本身！喜悦、不甘、意气……一切都在擂台之上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "64f1980a2cff7c45637d24bbf8b7234e96f75af5cff2b0b3dcb4b03e2f3d033b", "ja": "もう、とにかく一回、見に行きましょうよ！\nこの後、ここにいる全員で！　チケット取りますよ！", "zh": "哎呀，总之一同去看一次吧！\n待会儿，这里的大家一起去！我去弄门票！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0593_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2667384941c27dc9bfb9a3c5962a83bf4492fa682b075c4bfb08980ca48bcc10", "ja": "（その日、のり子の異様な熱さは、局のお偉いさんにも\n大好評だったらしい……試合終了、完全勝利だーっ！）", "zh": "（听说那天，法理子异乎寻常的热情大受电视台高层好评……比赛结束，彻底胜利啦——！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
